{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51078","headline":"七言记德诗三十首谨献司徒相公 生祠 · 崔致远","name":"七言记德诗三十首谨献司徒相公 生祠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古来难化是蛮夷，交趾何人得去思。\n万代圣朝青史上，独传溪洞立生祠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51078.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51078","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}